  "project_scope_summary": "Modern apps have new data challenges. AI applications are no exception. This dashboard will help you understand and manage the data your AI application generates.",
  "project_scope_full": "Modern apps have new data challenges. AI applications are no exception. This dashboard will help you understand and manage the data your AI application generates. It will provide a modern, intuitive interface for visualizing and analyzing the data your AI application generates. It will include features such as real-time data visualization, data filtering and sorting, and data export. We will use AI to come up with new ways to visualize the data on a regular basis, creating a self-improvement loop."
